 "description": "Inspects an exchange sign-up or referral link and reports evidence on five separate points: whether the domain is a verified official domain of a listed exchange, whether it is reachable, whose referral code it carries, how CoinRebate's records list the exchange for a given country, and what rebate (if any) is configured. Unknown items are reported as unknown. It never says a link is safe, never probes unrecognized domains, and never suggests a replacement link. Read-only.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
